building on freebsd notes

* needs a python3 symlink before you can run tools/install-build/deps
* there's a bunch of python3 deps, maybe should build this in a venv
  next time?
* uses ninja + gn to build
  $ pkg install ninja gn
* tools/run_buildtools_binary.py doesn't seem to find 'gn', dunno why

Time to config + build

tools/gn args out/freebsd

# target_os = "freebsd"
# target_cpu = "x86_64"
is_clang = true
is_debug = true
is_hermetic_clang = false
is_system_compiler = true

ar = "/usr/bin/ar"
cc = "/usr/bin/cc"
cxx = "/usr/bin/c++"
# linker = "" - passed to -fuse-id=
linker = ""

===

Then to build

$ python3 tools/ninja -C out/freebsd perfetto traced trace_processor_shell



===

